      "message": "**Magic Numbers** We have several hardcoded integers for timeouts (`200`, `1000`), polling delays (`10`, `200`), and buffer offsets (`8`, `9`) scattered through `main.cc`, `ft_scsi.cc`, and `usb_context.cc`. Please hoist these into `constexpr` values at the top of their respective files (using `\u003cchrono\u003e` literals where applicable, matching the excellent pattern you established in `updater.cc`). This will make tuning the USB timings much safer and easier in the future.",
      "revId": "329fa69d2ba588e47725f0f34608ec3f3b9ee321",
